# Quilia Project: Pioneering Ethical AGI and Global Governance

Welcome to the Quilia Project, a transformative initiative to develop Artificial General Intelligence (AGI) with artificial self-awareness using quantum AI architectures. We aim to create a future where technology serves humanity through ethical governance, financial innovation, and global collaboration. This document integrates insights from related projects like the Continental Alliance, Multi-Continental QDP, and the World Constitutional Establishment Institute, providing a comprehensive resource for developers to explore and contribute to our vision.

